@Practical_10_Student_REST_API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5289

### 1. Get all students
GET {{Practical_10_Student_REST_API_HostAddress}}/api/students
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get student by ID
GET {{Practical_10_Student_REST_API_HostAddress}}/api/students/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Add a new student
POST {{Practical_10_Student_REST_API_HostAddress}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aarav",
  "email": "aarav@gmail.com",
  "department": "Computer Science",
  "semester": 5
}

### 4. Update student (ID 1)
PUT {{Practical_10_Student_REST_API_HostAddress}}/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rahul Sharma",
  "email": "rahul.sharma@gmail.com",
  "department": "Computer Engineering",
  "semester": 6
}

### 5. Delete student (ID 2)
DELETE {{Practical_10_Student_REST_API_HostAddress}}/api/students/2

### Try to GET the deleted student by Id
GET {{Practical_10_Student_REST_API_HostAddress}}/api/students/2
Accept: application/json
